{"seq":2,"slug":"kafka-deep-dive","title":"Kafka 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/messaging-and-streaming/kafka-deep-dive","wordCount":1240,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"kafka-深入\">Kafka 深入</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Apache Kafka 是一个分布式流处理平台，最初由 LinkedIn 开发，现已成为大数据和实时处理领域的事实标准。Kafka 的核心设计——分区化的持久化日志——使其在吞吐量、可扩展性和容错性上表现卓越，广泛用于日志收集、事件流、流处理管道等场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Kafka 把一个&quot;分布式日志&quot;拆成了几个可独立理解的概念，它们是后续所有机制的基础：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Topic 与 Partition</strong>：Topic 是逻辑分类，Partition 是物理分片——它有序、不可变，是 Kafka 并行与顺序性的基本单元。</li>\n<li><strong>Offset 与 Segment</strong>：Offset 是分区内消息的唯一递增序号，Segment 是分区在磁盘上的日志段文件，二者共同定义了&quot;可回溯&quot;的语义。</li>\n<li><strong>ISR 与 HW</strong>：ISR 是与 Leader 保持同步的副本集合，HW 是所有 ISR 都已复制的最大 Offset——只有 HW 之前的消息才对消费者可见。</li>\n<li><strong>acks 与副本配置</strong>：acks=0/1/all 决定生产者等待多少副本确认，配合 min.insync.replicas 共同决定&quot;是否能容忍 Broker 宕机而不丢数据&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>主线：<strong>Kafka 的顺序性只保证在分区内，因此分区键的设计决定了业务的顺序语义；可靠性则由 acks 与 ISR 配置共同界定，<code>acks=all + min.insync.replicas=2 + 3 副本</code> 是允许单 Broker 宕机不丢数据的常用组合。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心架构\">核心架构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P1[Producer 1] --&gt; B1[Broker 1]&#10;  P2[Producer 2] --&gt; B2[Broker 2]&#10;  B1 --&gt; B3[Broker 3]&#10;  B2 --&gt; B3&#10;  B1 --&gt; C1[Consumer Group A]&#10;  B2 --&gt; C1&#10;  B3 --&gt; C2[Consumer Group B]&#10;  ZK[ZooKeeper / KRaft] --&gt; B1&#10;  ZK --&gt; B2&#10;  ZK --&gt; B3\">graph TD\n  P1[Producer 1] --&gt; B1[Broker 1]\n  P2[Producer 2] --&gt; B2[Broker 2]\n  B1 --&gt; B3[Broker 3]\n  B2 --&gt; B3\n  B1 --&gt; C1[Consumer Group A]\n  B2 --&gt; C1\n  B3 --&gt; C2[Consumer Group B]\n  ZK[ZooKeeper / KRaft] --&gt; B1\n  ZK --&gt; B2\n  ZK --&gt; B3</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Producer</td>\n<td>发布消息到 Topic 的特定 Partition</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Broker</td>\n<td>存储消息，处理读写请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Consumer</td>\n<td>从 Partition 拉取消费消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZooKeeper/KRaft</td>\n<td>集群元数据管理、Controller 选举</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"分区模型\">分区模型</h2><h3 id=\"topic-与-partition\">Topic 与 Partition</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Topic: orders&#10;├── Partition 0: [msg0, msg3, msg6, msg9, ...]&#10;├── Partition 1: [msg1, msg4, msg7, msg10, ...]&#10;└── Partition 2: [msg2, msg5, msg8, msg11, ...]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Topic: orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Partition 0: [msg0, msg3, msg6, msg9, ...]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Partition 1: [msg1, msg4, msg7, msg10, ...]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── Partition 2: [msg2, msg5, msg8, msg11, ...]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Topic</td>\n<td>消息的逻辑分类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Partition</td>\n<td>Topic 的物理分片，有序且不可变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Offset</td>\n<td>分区内消息的唯一递增序号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Segment</td>\n<td>分区在磁盘上的日志段文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"分区策略\">分区策略</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class Partitioner:&#10;    def partition(self, key, value, num_partitions):&#10;        if key is None:&#10;            return random.randint(0, num_partitions - 1)&#10;        return hash(key) % num_partitions\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Partitioner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> partition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, key, value, num_partitions):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> random.randint(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, num_partitions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> hash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_partitions</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"副本机制\">副本机制</h2><h3 id=\"isr-in-sync-replicas\">ISR（In-Sync Replicas）</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph Partition 0&#10;    L[Leader] --&gt;|复制| F1[Follower 1 - ISR]&#10;    L --&gt;|复制| F2[Follower 2 - ISR]&#10;    L -.-&gt;|落后太多| F3[Follower 3 - Out of Sync]&#10;  end\">graph LR\n  subgraph Partition 0\n    L[Leader] --&gt;|复制| F1[Follower 1 - ISR]\n    L --&gt;|复制| F2[Follower 2 - ISR]\n    L -.-&gt;|落后太多| F3[Follower 3 - Out of Sync]\n  end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Leader</td>\n<td>处理所有读写请求的副本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ISR</td>\n<td>与 Leader 保持同步的副本集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OSR</td>\n<td>同步落后超过阈值的副本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HW (High Watermark)</td>\n<td>所有 ISR 都已复制的最大 Offset</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LEO (Log End Offset)</td>\n<td>副本的最新 Offset</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"ack-配置\">ACK 配置</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>acks 值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>不等待确认</td>\n<td>可能丢失</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Leader 写入即确认</td>\n<td>可能丢失</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>all/-1</td>\n<td>所有 ISR 写入后确认</td>\n<td>不丢失</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"可靠配置组合：&#10;  acks=all + min.insync.replicas=2 + replication.factor=3&#10;  → 允许 1 个 Broker 宕机不丢数据\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>可靠配置组合：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  acks=all + min.insync.replicas=2 + replication.factor=3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 允许 1 个 Broker 宕机不丢数据</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"消费者与消费者组\">消费者与消费者组</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  T[Topic: 3 Partitions]&#10;  T --&gt; P0[Partition 0]&#10;  T --&gt; P1[Partition 1]&#10;  T --&gt; P2[Partition 2]&#10;  subgraph Consumer Group&#10;    C1[Consumer 1] -.-&gt; P0&#10;    C2[Consumer 2] -.-&gt; P1&#10;    C3[Consumer 3] -.-&gt; P2&#10;  end\">graph TD\n  T[Topic: 3 Partitions]\n  T --&gt; P0[Partition 0]\n  T --&gt; P1[Partition 1]\n  T --&gt; P2[Partition 2]\n  subgraph Consumer Group\n    C1[Consumer 1] -.-&gt; P0\n    C2[Consumer 2] -.-&gt; P1\n    C3[Consumer 3] -.-&gt; P2\n  end</pre><h3 id=\"rebalance\">Rebalance</h3><p>当消费者组成员变化时触发分区重新分配：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消费者加入</td>\n<td>新成员需要分配分区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费者退出</td>\n<td>其分区需要重新分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Topic 分区数变化</td>\n<td>新分区需要分配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Rebalance 策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Eager</td>\n<td>全部撤销后重新分配</td>\n<td>简单但有停顿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cooperative Sticky</td>\n<td>增量式重新分配</td>\n<td>平滑过渡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"exactly-once-语义\">Exactly-Once 语义</h2><p>Kafka 通过幂等生产者 + 事务实现 Exactly-Once：</p>\n<h3 id=\"幂等生产者\">幂等生产者</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Producer ID (PID) + Sequence Number&#10;→ Broker 去重相同 PID + SeqNum 的消息\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Producer ID (PID) + Sequence Number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>→ Broker 去重相同 PID + SeqNum 的消息</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"事务\">事务</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"producer = KafkaProducer(&#10;    transactional_id=&quot;order-processor-1&quot;,&#10;    enable_idempotence=True&#10;)&#10;&#10;producer.init_transactions()&#10;try:&#10;    producer.begin_transaction()&#10;    producer.send(&quot;output-topic&quot;, key=key, value=result)&#10;    producer.send_offsets_to_transaction(&#10;        offsets={TopicPartition(&quot;input-topic&quot;, 0): OffsetAndMetadata(offset + 1)},&#10;        group_id=&quot;my-group&quot;&#10;    )&#10;    producer.commit_transaction()&#10;except Exception:&#10;    producer.abort_transaction()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">producer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> KafkaProducer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    transactional_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-processor-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    enable_idempotence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">producer.init_transactions()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    producer.begin_transaction()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    producer.send(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"output-topic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">key, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    producer.send_offsets_to_transaction(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        offsets</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{TopicPartition(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"input-topic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">): OffsetAndMetadata(offset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        group_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-group\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    producer.commit_transaction()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">except</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Exception</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    producer.abort_transaction()</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"高性能设计\">高性能设计</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>顺序写磁盘</td>\n<td>追加写入日志文件</td>\n<td>接近内存速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Page Cache</td>\n<td>利用操作系统页面缓存</td>\n<td>减少磁盘 IO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Zero Copy</td>\n<td>sendfile() 直接从磁盘到网卡</td>\n<td>减少 CPU 拷贝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量处理</td>\n<td>批量发送和压缩</td>\n<td>减少网络往返</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分区并行</td>\n<td>多分区并行读写</td>\n<td>线性扩展</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"传统 IO:  磁盘 → 内核缓冲 → 用户缓冲 → Socket 缓冲 → 网卡  (4次拷贝)&#10;Zero Copy: 磁盘 → 内核缓冲 → 网卡                              (2次拷贝)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>传统 IO:  磁盘 → 内核缓冲 → 用户缓冲 → Socket 缓冲 → 网卡  (4次拷贝)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Zero Copy: 磁盘 → 内核缓冲 → 网卡                              (2次拷贝)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"kraft-模式\">KRaft 模式</h2><p>Kafka 正在从依赖 ZooKeeper 迁移到内置的 KRaft 共识：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比</th>\n<th>ZooKeeper 模式</th>\n<th>KRaft 模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>元数据管理</td>\n<td>外部 ZK 集群</td>\n<td>Kafka 内置 Raft</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署复杂度</td>\n<td>高（需维护 ZK）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分区上限</td>\n<td>~200K</td>\n<td>百万级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制器</td>\n<td>单一 Controller</td>\n<td>Controller Quorum</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"关键配置\">关键配置</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>建议值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>replication.factor</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>副本数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>min.insync.replicas</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>最小 ISR 数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>acks</td>\n<td>all</td>\n<td>生产者确认级别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>log.retention.hours</td>\n<td>168 (7天)</td>\n<td>消息保留时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>num.partitions</td>\n<td>按吞吐量估算</td>\n<td>默认分区数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>compression.type</td>\n<td>lz4</td>\n<td>压缩算法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>生产环境必须配置 <code>acks=all</code> + <code>min.insync.replicas=2</code> + 3 副本</li>\n<li>分区数根据期望吞吐量计算：分区数 ≥ 期望吞吐 / 单分区吞吐</li>\n<li>消息 key 保证同一业务实体的消息有序（如订单 ID）</li>\n<li>消费者数量不超过分区数——多余的消费者会空闲</li>\n<li>新集群使用 KRaft 模式，避免 ZooKeeper 的运维复杂度</li>\n<li>监控 Consumer Lag、ISR 缩减、Under-Replicated Partitions 等关键指标</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Kafka 卓越的吞吐来自把&quot;分布式日志&quot;做到极致：分区提供并行与顺序性的基本单元，顺序写磁盘、Page Cache、Zero Copy 与批量处理把它推向接近内存的速度。可靠性则由 ISR、HW 与 acks 配置共同界定——<code>acks=all + min.insync.replicas=2 + 3 副本</code> 是容忍单个 Broker 宕机不丢数据的常用组合；Exactly-Once 靠幂等生产者加事务实现。使用要点是：分区数按吞吐量估算、分区键决定业务顺序、消费者数不超过分区数，并持续监控 Consumer Lag 与 ISR 状态。新集群建议直接采用 KRaft 模式以省去 ZooKeeper 的运维复杂度。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Kafka 深入","id":"kafka-深入"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心架构","id":"核心架构"},{"level":2,"text":"分区模型","id":"分区模型"},{"level":3,"text":"Topic 与 Partition","id":"topic-与-partition"},{"level":3,"text":"分区策略","id":"分区策略"},{"level":2,"text":"副本机制","id":"副本机制"},{"level":3,"text":"ISR（In-Sync Replicas）","id":"isr-in-sync-replicas"},{"level":3,"text":"ACK 配置","id":"ack-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"消费者与消费者组","id":"消费者与消费者组"},{"level":3,"text":"Rebalance","id":"rebalance"},{"level":2,"text":"Exactly-Once 语义","id":"exactly-once-语义"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等生产者","id":"幂等生产者"},{"level":3,"text":"事务","id":"事务"},{"level":2,"text":"高性能设计","id":"高性能设计"},{"level":2,"text":"KRaft 模式","id":"kraft-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"关键配置","id":"关键配置"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"消息队列模型与选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/messaging-and-streaming/message-queue"},"next":{"title":"事件驱动架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/messaging-and-streaming/event-driven"}}